  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting GPC&apos;s work in reinforcing disability &amp; age inclusive and conflict-sensitive analyses to improve inclusion in protection coordination and leadership in humanitarian responses using an intersectional approach &#x2013; Phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analyse capacity and gaps to support mainstream disability (with intersectional lens with gender) and age inclusion   into protection coordination and leadership to promote inclusive and context-sensitive interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposed intervention aims at contributing to a holistic and systemic approach, geared towards capacity building of GPC HQ and field staff, as well as partners to ensure improved disability and age inclusive and conflict-sensitive protection coordination and leadership.</narrative>
  </description>
